{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:90d39562f81c3058","name":"Carbineer Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-90d39562f81c3058","title":"Carbineer Talent Tree","revision":20110,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:14:09Z","sha256":"b2c0529946a420062429906464845382fd4905fae20b7c84d68f91b5f0fde914","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20110","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Carbineer%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-90d39562f81c3058","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["While ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," offer great versatility and mobility, their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," is a significant limiting factor. Thus, many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunslingers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunslingers"}," choose to specialize in long arms, especially ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Carbines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Carbines"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blowback"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an attack with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," that deals damage in excess of your target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", you can choose to push the target 1 square away from you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Close Contact"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," or carbine you use is increased by 5 squares. Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," for the weapon begins 5 squares later, but still ends at the same distance. You can take this Talent up to two times; each time you take this Talent, you increase the Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," or carbine you use by an additional 5 squares, up to a maximum of 10 squares.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Multiattack Proficiency (Rifles)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you make multiple attacks with any type of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"},"), you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by 2. You can take this Talent multiple times; each time you take this Talent, you reduce the penalty on your attack rolls by an additional 2.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Old Faithful"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trusty Sidearm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trusty_Sidearm"}," Class Feature of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunslinger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunslinger","referenceId":"reference:223b23a5360318c7"}," Prestige Class also applies to any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," or carbine that you use.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Opportunity Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +2 bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," made with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Rifle Master"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You treat all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"}," as though they were ",{"tag":"a","children":["Accurate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accurate"}," weapons, taking no penalty when firing at targets at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shoot from the Hip"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can always use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Snap Shot"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You do not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," while using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aim","referenceId":"reference:28427fa78a230e42"}," Action with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," or carbine with its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Retractable Stock"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Retractable_Stock","referenceId":"reference:c46421d1c6248b43"}," extended.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
